		sub /
			<= Directory_title $mol_paragraph
				title @ \Journals here
			<= Directory_list $mol_list
				rows <= journal_rows /
	Journal_row* $bog_journal_app_nav
		arg <= journal_arg* *
		title <= journal_title* \

- Navigation link that never toggles itself off.
-
- $mol_link declares itself "current" as soon as every non-null key of its arg
- already matches the route, and a click on a current link goes to uri_off,
- which nulls every key the arg mentions. A nav link spells out the keys it
- wants cleared, so that inversion wipes the whole route and drops the app on
- the start screen. Pinning uri_off to uri makes a repeat click a no-op while
- keeping the mol_link_current attribute available for styling.
$bog_journal_app_nav $mol_link
	uri_off <= uri
